{"seq":2,"slug":"transitional-definitive-phase-timeline","title":"过渡期报告与正式期义务的时间轴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cbam-embedded-emissions-reporting/cbam-scope-timeline/transitional-definitive-phase-timeline","wordCount":2486,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"过渡期报告与正式期义务的时间轴\">过渡期报告与正式期义务的时间轴</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么-cbam-的时间轴是-两段制-而不是一条线\">核心概念：为什么 CBAM 的时间轴是&quot;两段制&quot;而不是一条线</h2><p>跨境卖家最容易犯的一个时间错误，是把 CBAM 理解成&quot;从某一天开始要交税&quot;。真实的架构是一条<strong>分段时钟</strong>：过渡期（transitional period）从 2023 年 10 月 1 日走到 2025 年 12 月 31 日，期间只要<strong>按季度报告</strong>而不付钱；正式期（definitive regime）从 <strong>2026 年 1 月 1 日</strong>起适用，才真正引入授权、证书购买与年度清缴义务（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism_en\">EC, CBAM</a>；欧洲议会立法列车把过渡期明确记为 2023-10-01 至 2025-12-31、全面实施自 2026-01-01 起，<a href=\"https://www.europarl.europa.eu/legislative-train/theme-a-european-green-deal/file-carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism\">EP Legislative Train</a>）。</p>\n<p>这两个时期不是&quot;同一件事的两个阶段&quot;，而是<strong>两套不同的合规对象</strong>。过渡期考的是&quot;你有没有把数据报上来&quot;，正式期考的是&quot;你有没有为这些排放买到并交出证书&quot;。对应的法规也不同：过渡期由实施条例 (EU) 2023/1773 规定报告格式与时限，正式期则由基础法规 (EU) 2023/956 及其 2025 年修订（(EU) 2025/2083，即所谓&quot;简化与强化 CBAM&quot;一揽子）与一系列实施条例共同规定（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-legislation-and-guidance_en\">EC, 立法与指南</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[2023-10-01 过渡期开始] --&gt; B[按季度提交 CBAM 报告&lt;br/&gt;只需申报, 无需缴费]&#10;  B --&gt; C[2025-12-31 过渡期结束]&#10;  C --&gt; D[2026-01-01 正式期开始]&#10;  D --&gt; E{进口人年累计&lt;br/&gt;&gt; 50 吨 CBAM 货物?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[继续进口, 无 CBAM 证书义务]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[申请授权 CBAM 申报人]&#10;  G --&gt; H[2026 各季度: 按季度均价&lt;br/&gt;记录排放对应证书成本]&#10;  H --&gt; I[2027-02 起: 中央平台&lt;br/&gt;开放证书购买]&#10;  I --&gt; J[2027-09-30 前: 提交首份&lt;br/&gt;年度 CBAM 申报并清缴证书]\">graph TD\n  A[2023-10-01 过渡期开始] --&gt; B[按季度提交 CBAM 报告&lt;br/&gt;只需申报, 无需缴费]\n  B --&gt; C[2025-12-31 过渡期结束]\n  C --&gt; D[2026-01-01 正式期开始]\n  D --&gt; E{进口人年累计&lt;br/&gt;&gt; 50 吨 CBAM 货物?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[继续进口, 无 CBAM 证书义务]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[申请授权 CBAM 申报人]\n  G --&gt; H[2026 各季度: 按季度均价&lt;br/&gt;记录排放对应证书成本]\n  H --&gt; I[2027-02 起: 中央平台&lt;br/&gt;开放证书购买]\n  I --&gt; J[2027-09-30 前: 提交首份&lt;br/&gt;年度 CBAM 申报并清缴证书]</pre><p>图上最关键的一处<strong>错位</strong>值得单独说：正式期从 2026 年 1 月 1 日就生效，但证书<strong>要到 2027 年 2 月才开卖</strong>（见下节）。也就是说 2026 年全年进口人是在&quot;记账但不能付钱&quot;的状态里运行，这一年的核心任务是<strong>把排放数据与商务台账对齐</strong>，而不是筹钱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过渡期-按季报告-无需缴费的季节-2023-10-至-2025-12\">过渡期：按季报告、无需缴费的季节（2023-10 至 2025-12）</h2><p>过渡期的报告义务有明确的时点节奏：进口人（或其报关代理）在每个日历季度结束后提交一份 CBAM 报告，报告该季度内进口货物的嵌入式排放、原产设施信息与已支付碳价。<strong>第一份报告的申报期在 2024 年 1 月 31 日截止</strong>（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-archive_en\">EC, CBAM 归档</a>），即 2023 年第四季度这一批进口要在次年 1 月底前报出。</p>\n<p>过渡期的工程负担集中在<strong>数据可得性</strong>而非资金：系统要能对每一批 CBAM 货物回答&quot;这批货的排放是多少、来自哪个设施、生产国有没有碳价&quot;。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 个季度内进口批次为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=1,\\dots,n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，每批净质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（吨）、单位排放强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（吨 CO₂e/吨），则该季报表的核心量是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_q = \\sum_{b \\in q} m_b \\cdot e_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在过渡期是<strong>报告项</strong>，在正式期同一公式会变成<strong>缴费基数</strong>。正因为如此，过渡期常被当作&quot;练手年&quot;：如果一季度报表里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 长期是默认值而不是生产商实测值，进入正式期后这笔差价会直接落到授权申报人的账上。</p>\n<p>过渡期还有一条容易被忽略的规则——<strong>延期提交</strong>。委员会为过渡期提供了&quot;Request Delayed Submission&quot;指引（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-archive_en\">EC, CBAM 归档</a>），允许在数据尚未齐备时申请延后报送。这类机制是<strong>过渡期专属的缓冲</strong>，正式期的年度申报没有等价的&quot;晚交三个月&quot;选项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正式期-授权-记账-清缴的三段时钟-2026-01-01-起\">正式期：授权、记账、清缴的三段时钟（2026-01-01 起）</h2><p>正式期把义务拆成三件在不同时点触发的事，理解它们的关键是分清&quot;何时发生&quot;：</p>\n<p><strong>第一段——授权（进口前置）</strong>。把超过 <strong>50 吨 CBAM 货物</strong>引入欧盟的进口人或其间接海关代理，必须申请授权 CBAM 申报人身份（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-definitive-regime_en\">EC, 正式期</a>）。这是一道<strong>放行前的门</strong>：没有授权，CBAM 货物在海关层面走不通。门槛是按申报主体、按年累计的质量线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>cum</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>b</mi></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{cum}}(y)=\\sum_b m_b &gt; 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cum</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>（吨），而不是按单票报关单计——主体的识别与申请细节见本 hub 的 <a href=\"importer-declarant-authorisation\">进口商身份、授权申报人与责任主体</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>第二段——记账与持有（全年滚动）</strong>。授权申报人对每一批进口货物记录其嵌入式排放对应的证书数量，并按&quot;<strong>50% 规则</strong>&quot;在全年滚动持有一定比例的证书。委员会的登记系统（CBAM Registry）内置的 DRMC 组件明确用于帮助申报人&quot;监控并预判 50% 规则的要求&quot;（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-registry_en\">EC, CBAM Registry</a>）。这条规则在时间轴上的意义是：<strong>缴费不是年末一次性动作，而是全年分摊的持有义务</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>第三段——年度申报与清缴（每年 9 月底）</strong>。自 2027 年起，进口人须在<strong>每年 9 月 30 日前</strong>就上一年度的进口提交年度 CBAM 申报，并清缴相应数量的 CBAM 证书（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-communication-and-faqs_en\">EC, 沟通与 FAQ</a>）。因此<strong>首个正式期申报截止日是 2027 年 9 月 30 日</strong>，覆盖 2026 年全年的进口。这条 9 月 30 日的时点是整条时间轴的重心：它把 2026 年一整年的进口数据、证书持有和资金安排全部收束到同一天。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键日期一览\">关键日期一览</h2><p>把两个时期的硬时点压进一张表，是排期与系统需求评审最实用的形式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>依据 / 来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2023-10-01</td>\n<td>过渡期开始</td>\n<td>按季报告</td>\n<td>(EU) 2023/1773</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2024-01-31</td>\n<td>首份季度报告截止</td>\n<td>报告（无缴费）</td>\n<td>EC, CBAM 归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-12-31</td>\n<td>过渡期结束</td>\n<td>报告义务终止</td>\n<td>EP Legislative Train</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026-01-01</td>\n<td>正式期开始，授权与记账义务生效</td>\n<td>授权 + 记账</td>\n<td>EC, 正式期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026 全年</td>\n<td>证书<strong>未开卖</strong>，只记排放与成本</td>\n<td>记账（不付款）</td>\n<td>(EU) 2023/956 第 20 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026-04-07</td>\n<td>公布 2026 Q1 季度价 75.36 €/t</td>\n<td>定价</td>\n<td>EC, 证书价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026-07-06</td>\n<td>公布 2026 Q2 季度价 75.28 €/t</td>\n<td>定价</td>\n<td>EC, 证书价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2027-02</td>\n<td>中央平台开放 CBAM 证书购买</td>\n<td>购买开放</td>\n<td>(EU) 2023/956 第 20 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2027-09-30</td>\n<td><strong>首份年度 CBAM 申报并清缴证书</strong></td>\n<td>申报 + 清缴</td>\n<td>EC, 沟通与 FAQ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"证书价格与销售的时点-从季度价到周价\">证书价格与销售的时点：从季度价到周价</h2><p>正式期的&quot;钱&quot;有一个独特的<strong>时间机制</strong>，直接影响报价与成本核算。证书价格不另行设定，而是挂钩 EU ETS 配额拍卖：按 (EU) 2023/956 与实施条例 (EU) 2025/2548，价格取<strong>已拍卖 EU ETS 配额的加权平均结算价</strong>（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/price-cbam-certificates_en\">EC, 证书价格</a>）。但价格的<strong>计算频率</strong>分两段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2026 年</strong>：按<strong>季度</strong>定价，每个日历季度四个价格，在各季度结束后第一周算出，季度价对应同季度进口货物产生的排放。已公布值：Q1 为 <strong>75.36 €/t</strong>（2026-04-07 公布），Q2 为 <strong>75.28 €/t</strong>（2026-07-06 公布）。</li>\n<li><strong>2027 年起</strong>：切换为<strong>周价</strong>，更新频率提高一个量级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>设某季度进口的应缴吨数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，该季度公布价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该季度对账金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_q = E_q \\cdot p_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。而证书的<strong>实际购买</strong>要到 <strong>2027 年 2 月</strong>才在中央平台开放（第 20 条，<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/price-cbam-certificates_en\">EC, 证书价格</a>）。由此产生一个时间轴上独有的组合：<strong>2026 年的排放按 2026 年的季度价锁定成本，但付款动作推迟到 2027 年</strong>——财务上必须在 2026 年就按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计提这笔负债，而不是等到 2027 年见票才认。</p>\n<p>价格从季价改为周价，对系统还有一层含义：2027 年起证书成本<strong>不再是一个季度一个数</strong>，而是每天变动。若内部系统仍按&quot;每季度取一个价&quot;建模，2027 年一开年就会出现持仓估值偏差与 50% 规则持有量算不准的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间轴错位带来的工程问题\">时间轴错位带来的工程问题</h2><p>把上面几条时点叠起来，会看到三处<strong>彼此错位</strong>的时钟，这正是 CBAM 系统的难点所在：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>进口时钟</strong>（海关放行，按票发生）——粒度是报关单，实时。</li>\n<li><strong>排放时钟</strong>（数据采集与核查，按批次发生）——依赖上游设施提供实测值，天然滞后。</li>\n<li><strong>缴费时钟</strong>（季度定价、2 月开放购买、9 月 30 日清缴）——断点式、年度收束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>系统设计要在这三条时钟之间做<strong>对账</strong>，而不是假设它们同步。最典型的三类故障：其一，把 50 吨门槛按<strong>单票</strong>判定而非按主体年累计，导致该申请授权的进口人漏申请；其二，用<strong>默认值</strong>填充缺失的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，把数据问题拖到 9 月 30 日变成资金问题；其三，把证书负债按&quot;付款时点&quot;而非&quot;排放发生时点&quot;入账，导致 2026 年报表低估负债。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[海关放行&lt;br/&gt;按票·实时] --&gt; B[排放数据采集&lt;br/&gt;按批次·滞后]&#10;  B --&gt; C[季度价锁定成本&lt;br/&gt;2026 季价/2027 周价]&#10;  C --&gt; D[2 月开放购买&lt;br/&gt;中央平台]&#10;  D --&gt; E[9-30 年度申报&lt;br/&gt;并清缴证书]&#10;  F[50 吨门槛&lt;br/&gt;按主体年累计] --&gt; D&#10;  E --&gt; G[持续对账&lt;br/&gt;ERP 进口台账 ↔ DRMC 视图]\">graph LR\n  A[海关放行&lt;br/&gt;按票·实时] --&gt; B[排放数据采集&lt;br/&gt;按批次·滞后]\n  B --&gt; C[季度价锁定成本&lt;br/&gt;2026 季价/2027 周价]\n  C --&gt; D[2 月开放购买&lt;br/&gt;中央平台]\n  D --&gt; E[9-30 年度申报&lt;br/&gt;并清缴证书]\n  F[50 吨门槛&lt;br/&gt;按主体年累计] --&gt; D\n  E --&gt; G[持续对账&lt;br/&gt;ERP 进口台账 ↔ DRMC 视图]</pre><p>值得注意的是委员会的登记系统本身也在<strong>随时间演进</strong>：非欧盟设施运营方门户的访问指引标注 2026 年 2 月、申报人门户手册标注 2026 年 8 月（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-registry_en\">EC, CBAM Registry</a>）。这意味着 2026 年是&quot;一边运行一边上线功能&quot;的一年，对接时要以门户的<strong>当期文档版本</strong>为准，不能照抄半年前的设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CBAM 是<strong>分段时钟</strong>：过渡期 2023-10-01 至 2025-12-31 只报告不缴费；正式期自 <strong>2026-01-01</strong> 起引入授权、记账与清缴。</li>\n<li>过渡期的核心量是季度报表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_q=\\sum_{b\\in q} m_b e_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，&quot;延期提交&quot;是过渡期专属缓冲；正式期把同一公式变成缴费基数。</li>\n<li>正式期的三段时点：授权（进口前置，50 吨/主体/年门槛）、50% 规则（全年滚动持有）、<strong>9 月 30 日</strong>年度申报并清缴（首份为 <strong>2027-09-30</strong>）。</li>\n<li>证书价格 2026 年按<strong>季度</strong>（Q1 75.36、Q2 75.28 €/t）、2027 年起按<strong>周</strong>；证书自 <strong>2027 年 2 月</strong>才开放购买——2026 年排放须提前计提负债。</li>\n<li>系统须对齐<strong>进口、排放、缴费</strong>三条错位时钟，把 50 吨门槛判定、默认值风险与负债入账时点作为硬约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上游数据采集与核查决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实测还是默认，这是本 hub 第三章的主题；本文的时点则定义了这些数据<strong>必须在什么时候到位</strong>。范围判定的前置问题见 <a href=\"cbam-goods-cn-code-scope\">CBAM 覆盖货物与 CN 编码判定</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"过渡期报告与正式期义务的时间轴","id":"过渡期报告与正式期义务的时间轴"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么 CBAM 的时间轴是\"两段制\"而不是一条线","id":"核心概念-为什么-cbam-的时间轴是-两段制-而不是一条线"},{"level":2,"text":"过渡期：按季报告、无需缴费的季节（2023-10 至 2025-12）","id":"过渡期-按季报告-无需缴费的季节-2023-10-至-2025-12"},{"level":2,"text":"正式期：授权、记账、清缴的三段时钟（2026-01-01 起）","id":"正式期-授权-记账-清缴的三段时钟-2026-01-01-起"},{"level":2,"text":"关键日期一览","id":"关键日期一览"},{"level":2,"text":"证书价格与销售的时点：从季度价到周价","id":"证书价格与销售的时点-从季度价到周价"},{"level":2,"text":"时间轴错位带来的工程问题","id":"时间轴错位带来的工程问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CBAM 覆盖货物与 CN 编码判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cbam-embedded-emissions-reporting/cbam-scope-timeline/cbam-goods-cn-code-scope"},"next":{"title":"进口商身份、授权申报人与责任主体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cbam-embedded-emissions-reporting/cbam-scope-timeline/importer-declarant-authorisation"}}